    focus: 'Post-pivot framing: characterization + methodology paper, NOT methods
      paper. Key new evidence since last Dream: (1) GSM8K cross-benchmark replication
      ΔTPR=+0.818, (2) GSM1K contamination gap anti-correlation r=−0.478 — DIF captures
      capability-discriminative items that contamination can''t fake, (3) downstream
      impact z=-8 to -49σ confirming DIF items are discriminative carriers. Assess
      whether these strengthen ICLR main conference viability vs findings track.'
