    project: irt_equated_bench_regen
    status: done
    review_mode: full
    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: ''
    focus: 'This is a post-revision re-dream. Key changes since Dream #3: (1) paper_framing.md
      rewritten with no-pivot narrative, scope pruning (Bayesian DIF/RL/ensemble/pilots
      → appendix), explicit 3-layer novelty articulation, "instability ≠ invalidity"
      framing upfront; (2) 6 new robustness analyses with real data: threshold sensitivity
      (49/31/18/10%), BH FDR (negligible), instability decomposition (≤2.4pp/7.6%),
      circularity ablation (DIF least disruptive non-random), architecture stratification
      (99.98% decoder-only, concern dissolved), bootstrap CIs (all exclude zero);
      (3) literature expanded 15→45 papers across 5 clusters; (4) experiments.tex
      completed with Reviewer patches. Focus review on whether the structural/writing
      improvements address the prior round''s concerns.'
    what_if: []
